# Fine-tuning ran on 16 NVIDIA A100 (40 GiB) GPUs; no durations are given.

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The tables report root-mean-square deviations (RMSDs) of predictions from DFT, encoded as RMSE. Stress RMSDs are in meV/A3 (no schema unit; recorded with unit null). Training and validation errors are in the SI figures.
# - Element-wise energy MAEs on QMOF (0.016 eV/atom for MACE-MP-MOF0-v2, MACE-MP-0b 80 % larger) are summary statements over a figure in the SI; lattice-parameter, phonon-frequency, bulk-modulus, CTE and fractional-position deviations (Tables 2, 5-7) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/elena2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

